      ],
      "explanation": "<p>The highest possible oxidation states of uranium and plutonium can be identified by considering the electronic configurations of these elements and noting the number of valence electrons available for bonding.</p>\n<p>Uranium (U, atomic number 92) has the electronic configuration: \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.411ex\" height=\"2.452ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 6369.8 1083.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1037,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1637,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1915,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(2415,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(636,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3454.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(3954.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(606.2,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4964.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(5464.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(502,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Plutonium (Pu, atomic number 94) has the electronic configuration: \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.996ex\" height=\"2.452ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 4860.1 1083.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1037,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1637,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1915,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(2415,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(636,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3454.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(3954.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(502,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>To find the highest oxidation state, we sum the number of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.183ex\" height=\"1.593ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 523 704\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.464ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.244ex\" height=\"2.059ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 550 910\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.061ex\" height=\"1.023ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 469 452\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> electrons in the valence shell.</p>\n<p>For uranium :\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21.843ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 9654.4 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(889,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1439,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2050.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3050.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3550.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3939.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4462.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5073.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(6073.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6573.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(6962.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7431.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8098.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(9154.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>So the highest oxidation state of uranium is +6.</p>\n<p>For plutonium :\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.002ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 6631 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(889,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1439,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2050.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3050.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3550.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3939.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4408.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5075.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(6131,0)\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>So the highest oxidation state of plutonium is +8. However, in practice, plutonium is known to exhibit a highest oxidation state of +7.</p>\n<p>Comparing with the given options, the correct answer is :</p>\n<p>Option D : 6 and 7.</p>"
